nstitute.deepmind.com/essays/economic-policy-for-agi/\"> <div><header><h2>Economic policy for AGI</h2><p data-block-key=\"nvk65\">This essay evaluates eleven policies societies could implement to manage the potential economic disruption arising from increasingly advanced and pervasive AI.</p><p>Julian Jacobs and Alex Imas</p></header><figure><picture><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1CX-ewGqhGvhqw1Dh4H3wvLzK3dU-V0Zx09t95vsejD5h-NYoJ4C51U2kgaNCyHFPVGAeZ34mNLBCBNQ8W1OuErlx8UIoqbHpE3NQED7jeO8S0lmcew=w1440-rw-lo\" srcset=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1CX-ewGqhGvhqw1Dh4H3wvLzK3dU-V0Zx09t95vsejD5h-NYoJ4C51U2kgaNCyHFPVGAeZ34mNLBCBNQ8W1OuErlx8UIoqbHpE3NQED7jeO8S0lmcew=w393-rw-lo 393w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1CX-ewGqhGvhqw1Dh4H3wvLzK3dU-V0Zx09t95vsejD5h-NYoJ4C51U2kgaNCyHFPVGAeZ34mNLBCBNQ8W1OuErlx8UIoqbHpE3NQED7jeO8S0lmcew=w480-rw-lo 480w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1CX-ewGqhGvhqw1Dh4H3wvLzK3dU-V0Zx09t95vsejD5h-NYoJ4C51U2kgaNCyHFPVGAeZ34mNLBCBNQ8W1OuErlx8UIoqbHpE3NQED7jeO8S0lmcew=w640-rw-lo 640w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1CX-ewGqhGvhqw1Dh4H3wvLzK3dU-V0Zx09t95vsejD5h-NYoJ4C51U2kgaNCyHFPVGAeZ34mNLBCBNQ8W1OuErlx8UIoqbHpE3NQED7jeO8S0lmcew=w768-rw-lo 768w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1CX-ewGqhGvhqw1Dh4H3wvLzK3dU-V0Zx09t95vsejD5h-NYoJ4C51U2kgaNCyHFPVGAeZ34mNLBCBNQ8W1OuErlx8UIoqbHpE3NQED7jeO8S0lmcew=w1024-rw-lo 1024w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1CX-ewGqhGvhqw1Dh4H3wvLzK3dU-V0Zx09t95vsejD5h-NYoJ4C51U2kgaNCyHFPVGAeZ34mNLBCBNQ8W1OuErlx8UIoqbHpE3NQED7jeO8S0lmcew=w1440-rw-lo 1440w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1CX-ewGqhGvhqw1Dh4H3wvLzK3dU-V0Zx09t95vsejD5h-NYoJ4C51U2kgaNCyHFPVGAeZ34mNLBCBNQ8W1OuErlx8UIoqbHpE3NQED7jeO8S0lmcew=w1728-rw-lo 1728w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1CX-ewGqhGvhqw1Dh4H3wvLzK3dU-V0Zx09t95vsejD5h-NYoJ4C51U2kgaNCyHFPVGAeZ34mNLBCBNQ8W1OuErlx8UIoqbHpE3NQED7jeO8S0lmcew=w2880-rw-lo 2880w\" alt=\"dmi_illustration_article_3_static-cropped\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"3000\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto\" width=\"3000\"></picture></figure></div> </a> </dmi-card><dmi-card data-aspect-ratio=\"16-9\" data-hydration=\"client:idle\" data-orientation=\"landscape\" data-scale=\"standard\" data-surface=\"surface\" data-variant=\"standard\"> <a data-gtm-param-content-name=\"Essays - Principles for a new utopianism\" data-gtm-event=\"select_content\" data-gtm-param-content-type=\"internal\" data-gtm-param-section-name=\"Essays\" href=\"https://institute.deepmind.com/essays/principles-for-a-new-utopianism/\"> <div><header><h2>Principles for a new utopianism</h2><p data-block-key=\"eh1w9\">If AGI is to transform society, we must decide what transformations we want. Learning from the turmoil of the twentieth century, this essay proposes a pragmatic utopianism of humility and hope.</p><p>Stephen Cave</p></header><figure><picture><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/V8xp3yFtEn0gooSIl9EVOtDdss7qTRg3XnphKhxSx7E4Kw6a71ts_58vD4nDIRLdlZN1kK3St0OUxgaTGDTMikcaQDW0L-CSbJUXtxhCJvSI7oUJjA=w1440-rw-lo\" srcset=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/V8xp3yFtEn0gooSIl9EVOtDdss7qTRg3XnphKhxSx7E4Kw6a71ts_58vD4nDIRLdlZN1kK3St0OUxgaTGDTMikcaQDW0L-CSbJUXtxhCJvSI7oUJjA=w393-rw-lo 393w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/V8xp3yFtEn0gooSIl9EVOtDdss7qTRg3XnphKhxSx7E4Kw6a71ts_58vD4nDIRLdlZN1kK3St0OUxgaTGDTMikcaQDW0L-CSbJUXtxhCJvSI7oUJjA=w480-rw-lo 480w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/V8xp3yFtEn0gooSIl9EVOtDdss7qTRg3XnphKhxSx7E4Kw6a71ts_58vD4nDIRLdlZN1kK3St0OUxgaTGDTMikcaQDW0L-CSbJUXtxhCJvSI7oUJjA=w640-rw-lo 640w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/V8xp3yFtEn0gooSIl9EVOtDdss7qTRg3XnphKhxSx7E4Kw6a71ts_58vD4nDIRLdlZN1kK3St0OUxgaTGDTMikcaQDW0L-CSbJUXtxhCJvSI7oUJjA=w768-rw-lo 768w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/V8xp3yFtEn0gooSIl9EVOtDdss7qTRg3XnphKhxSx7E4Kw6a71ts_58vD4nDIRLdlZN1kK3St0OUxgaTGDTMikcaQDW0L-CSbJUXtxhCJvSI7oUJjA=w1024-rw-lo 1024w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/V8xp3yFtEn0gooSIl9EVOtDdss7qTRg3XnphKhxSx7E4Kw6a71ts_58vD4nDIRLdlZN1kK3St0OUxgaTGDTMikcaQDW0L-CSbJUXtxh